  "title": "Grilled Sweet Potato Wedges",
  "description": "These grilled sweet potato wedges are brushed with olive oil, paprika, garlic, and cayenne for a smoky, caramelized flavor you can’t achieve in the oven.",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
  ],
